  "title": "Display DynamicAnimation According to the Battle Background [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "戦闘背景に合わせてDynamicAnimationを表示【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "6e9d6c1d6142b1224e8daaebea4950b1c5caaead762479f52c6f4896316b8218",
      "translation": "Display DynamicAnimation According to the Battle Background [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "6e9d6c1d6142b1224e8daaebea4950b1c5caaead762479f52c6f4896316b8218"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "戦闘背景に合わせてDynamicAnimationを表示します。",
      "sourceHash": "d52f374dd4b3ad2ecfa5a4e012cddbbff392d480a84401f4a2125d0279b4bb25",
      "translation": "Displays DynamicAnimation according to the battle background.",
      "contextHash": "d52f374dd4b3ad2ecfa5a4e012cddbbff392d480a84401f4a2125d0279b4bb25"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ついでにコモンイベントも実行できます。",
      "sourceHash": "5e6864798da55ebd62d2a99f40fba68f9bd073cbebc31c1ef8d048fcf66d5322",
      "translation": "You can also execute a common event.",
      "contextHash": "5e6864798da55ebd62d2a99f40fba68f9bd073cbebc31c1ef8d048fcf66d5322"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "炎上する町、海底、ボス戦における謎演出などに便利です。",
      "sourceHash": "15caea538abbc19d1b3398dfd9a9ccb97e856e13dd2f836b4ddcf22715060223",
      "translation": "Useful for scenes such as a burning town, the ocean floor, or mysterious effects during a boss battle.",
      "contextHash": "15caea538abbc19d1b3398dfd9a9ccb97e856e13dd2f836b4ddcf22715060223"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のファイルをダウンロードし 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "add69b36d300edf1592f52945943668587da00473f5edb9e6c87aeb402e1aa25",
      "translation": "Download the following file and place it in [Project]\\\\js\\\\plugins. Turn the plugin ON in the Plugin Manager.",
      "contextHash": "add69b36d300edf1592f52945943668587da00473f5edb9e6c87aeb402e1aa25"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＶ、ＭＺの両方で有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5",
      "translation": "※This plugin works with both MV and MZ.",
      "contextHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5"
    },
    {
