    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※本プラグインより上側にこれらを配置してください。",
      "sourceHash": "1a4f3a0e872d68d9e6bc759347a433a694c5ee2fbca295aa74a43cf12903e6ae",
      "translation": "※Place these above this plugin.",
