      "source": "英語対応漏れを修正。",
      "sourceHash": "996e23da82e7a23487d5d57f2b7d0902a9978a0205ad519ce9dcfc6c2108442b",
      "translation": "Fixed missing English support.",
      "contextHash": "996e23da82e7a23487d5d57f2b7d0902a9978a0205ad519ce9dcfc6c2108442b"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2022/07/04（ver1.02）",
      "sourceHash": "e1edccd2beb91e670f75f27889578a2e44e62e76c7f02b29b69e4c2928b581a6",
      "translation": "2022/07/04 (ver1.02) ",
      "contextHash": "e1edccd2beb91e670f75f27889578a2e44e62e76c7f02b29b69e4c2928b581a6"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-003",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "カーソル選択時に先頭の敵の点滅が乱れる不具合修正。",
      "sourceHash": "5735fd78449d82d9aec335e3efa724ea532e7c935e2a25c36af7f97f2b7ef983",
      "translation": "Fixed an issue where the flashing of the first enemy became erratic when selecting with the cursor.",
      "contextHash": "5735fd78449d82d9aec335e3efa724ea532e7c935e2a25c36af7f97f2b7ef983"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-004",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "※内部的に先頭の敵にアニメを表示するのではなく、ダミーの敵を作って表示するように変更しました。",
      "sourceHash": "823fc68328887530533bf51dbcd90cb418bd400e2ac268fcd8be482a3b6254f7",
      "translation": "※Changed the implementation so that an animation is displayed on a dummy enemy instead of the first enemy.",
      "contextHash": "823fc68328887530533bf51dbcd90cb418bd400e2ac268fcd8be482a3b6254f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "2022/06/04（ver1.011）",
      "sourceHash": "1f7a1294de8c119b873fc1d885f890920b68b5513e70534ca1ab001d8aa42278",
      "translation": "2022/06/04 (ver1.011) ",
      "contextHash": "1f7a1294de8c119b873fc1d885f890920b68b5513e70534ca1ab001d8aa42278"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-005",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "それに合わせて、DynamicAnimationを必須ではなくした。（ver1.011）",
      "sourceHash": "e8e4f6c1db5c129df817bddf466a62fc90e5e3cd5457f4e924d8e7e87574b5be",
      "translation": "Accordingly, DynamicAnimation is no longer required. (ver1.011)",
      "contextHash": "e8e4f6c1db5c129df817bddf466a62fc90e5e3cd5457f4e924d8e7e87574b5be"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-011",
      "type": "heading",
