      "translation": "2022/05/18 (ver1.00) ",
      "contextHash": "d97ea4c1838dccb4e0c2eb490192389fab0a1af302fdb750ff1a0f472db35f2d"
    },
    {
      "id": "list-006",
      "type": "list",
      "source": "公開！",
      "sourceHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664",
      "translation": "Released!",
      "contextHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-012",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "使用方法（Usage）",
      "sourceHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9",
      "translation": "Usage (Usage)",
      "contextHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "設定は戦闘背景（battlebacks1, battlebacks2）のファイル毎に行います。",
      "sourceHash": "816b27520b820962684d64a15631ca3ca45d9c47a1088691892e0b6847c4e8ff",
      "translation": "Settings are configured for each battle background (battlebacks1, battlebacks2) file.",
      "contextHash": "816b27520b820962684d64a15631ca3ca45d9c47a1088691892e0b6847c4e8ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "各設定リストにファイルと表示するスキル番号を指定してください。",
      "sourceHash": "196ade2ad06cd8679f75be4b2fb60e631da183bb5aad45a5eaa69697cea8c2a9",
      "translation": "Specify the file and the skill ID to display in each settings list.",
      "contextHash": "196ade2ad06cd8679f75be4b2fb60e631da183bb5aad45a5eaa69697cea8c2a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "一つの背景に対して複数のDynamicAnimationを指定することも可能です。",
      "sourceHash": "530759f4dab09eefd84820881c8ad16127fe8bda358ac554fc7253b01ed9e220",
      "translation": "You can specify multiple DynamicAnimations for a single background.",
      "contextHash": "530759f4dab09eefd84820881c8ad16127fe8bda358ac554fc7253b01ed9e220"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "戦闘背景１と戦闘背景２の両方を条件にした場合は、両方が一致した場合のみDynamicAnimationの表示を行います。",
      "sourceHash": "eefd93ab18819cd324f46012f1b06a6cb2c38c0f0b85f0d6e317d460c9d61060",
      "translation": "If both Battleback 1 and Battleback 2 are specified as conditions, DynamicAnimation is displayed only when both match.",
      "contextHash": "eefd93ab18819cd324f46012f1b06a6cb2c38c0f0b85f0d6e317d460c9d61060"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "通常は片方だけで十分だと思います。",
      "sourceHash": "718cde1b0250c9c1acf86ce992f8dfd4e7ee69d31a82992b3fe69859a9bca86f",
      "translation": "Normally, specifying just one should be sufficient.",
      "contextHash": "718cde1b0250c9c1acf86ce992f8dfd4e7ee69d31a82992b3fe69859a9bca86f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、条件を何も指定しなかった場合は常に実行します。",
      "sourceHash": "885128b2196795524ea1b6261b289ebc7cf467d0ab5a9919d7289b4049be45b5",
      "translation": "If no conditions are specified, it will always execute.",
      "contextHash": "885128b2196795524ea1b6261b289ebc7cf467d0ab5a9919d7289b4049be45b5"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "基本的には、画面全体に対して表示するアニメーションを想定しています。",
      "sourceHash": "2769ae2300d9d2e7b866de7f901af8879e5ec62b1430b96156e05729cf3f9929",
      "translation": "Basically, this is intended for animations displayed across the entire screen.",
      "contextHash": "2769ae2300d9d2e7b866de7f901af8879e5ec62b1430b96156e05729cf3f9929"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-016",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "具体的には、マップ版DynamicAnimationの各サンプルをご覧ください。",
      "sourceHash": "e6bec87bd2e04c57054e2eaf7fb567afdb6f4a76b860e604d6705aa895a6204a",
      "translation": "For details, see the samples for the map version of DynamicAnimation.",
      "contextHash": "e6bec87bd2e04c57054e2eaf7fb567afdb6f4a76b860e604d6705aa895a6204a"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-006",
      "type": "link",
      "source": "https://newrpg.seesaa.net/article/477704129.html",
      "sourceHash": "8888e856bd10a520fd1a857ead5fa1816719a34600f445afd983b7c4aec24c2a",
      "translation": "https://newrpg.seesaa.net/article/477704129.html",
      "contextHash": "77ca610762a59cab6102832ab2e8ff2f068781d2cd0a3ccd8ad177a74ceb3fc8"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-013",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "注意点（Notice）",
      "sourceHash": "fa3299f1e938208d8e5b6d58c9b496bc8f9347c77a554d10a359ea869f0706a0",
      "translation": "Notice (Notice)",
      "contextHash": "fa3299f1e938208d8e5b6d58c9b496bc8f9347c77a554d10a359ea869f0706a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-017",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "条件にスイッチを指定することもできますが、戦闘中に切り替えても即座に反映されない仕様です。",
      "sourceHash": "56ada75b5ccd5425b28e3f4124d7b93fbfe4762ab48a05fc4f5da2f6bc558d0d",
      "translation": "You can also specify a switch as a condition, but changes made during battle will not be reflected immediately.",
      "contextHash": "56ada75b5ccd5425b28e3f4124d7b93fbfe4762ab48a05fc4f5da2f6bc558d0d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-018",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "そういった細かい制御が必要な場合は、NRP_BattleParallelCommon.jsをオススメします。",
      "sourceHash": "faf6b4fe0e92d2eb1dadfa0e7a91c8ca77eb43284d05f96a60c9e2b3bbbf114e",
      "translation": "If you need such fine-grained control, I recommend NRP_BattleParallelCommon.js.",
      "contextHash": "faf6b4fe0e92d2eb1dadfa0e7a91c8ca77eb43284d05f96a60c9e2b3bbbf114e"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-014",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameters）",
      "sourceHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameters)",
      "contextHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-015",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "戦闘背景の設定（BattlebackSettingList）",
      "sourceHash": "90b0edfd95c0df08214271aaf51a53ae228b9f880e8594f34cd17e96080bb3ee",
      "translation": "Battle Background Settings (BattlebackSettingList)",
      "contextHash": "90b0edfd95c0df08214271aaf51a53ae228b9f880e8594f34cd17e96080bb3ee"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-019",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "戦闘背景毎の設定一覧です。",
      "sourceHash": "1408dc202be4a0c815147f3bddecb95bba7622629f5780ddc8fa3b6fba5a2f3a",
      "translation": "A list of settings for each battle background.",
      "contextHash": "1408dc202be4a0c815147f3bddecb95bba7622629f5780ddc8fa3b6fba5a2f3a"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-020",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "詳細は戦闘背景のプラグインパラメータをご覧ください。",
      "sourceHash": "3677fe619eba9ac879d13283ec4b8ffc5a1ae51f36dcacc94967ca8b8049f477",
      "translation": "For details, see the battle background plugin parameters.",
      "contextHash": "3677fe619eba9ac879d13283ec4b8ffc5a1ae51f36dcacc94967ca8b8049f477"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-016",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "共通コモンイベント（CommonCommonEvent）",
      "sourceHash": "b91657ff25b44da50ad033bf58832978dd5a65cfa2dc75d3324e32d34713933e",
      "translation": "Common Common Event (CommonCommonEvent)",
      "contextHash": "b91657ff25b44da50ad033bf58832978dd5a65cfa2dc75d3324e32d34713933e"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-021",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "戦闘開始直後に実行するコモンイベントです。",
      "sourceHash": "70562a89d198df969f456a7d131d0c82d53aeab6cb86960078be255c5b956578",
      "translation": "The common event executed immediately after battle begins.",
      "contextHash": "70562a89d198df969f456a7d131d0c82d53aeab6cb86960078be255c5b956578"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-022",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "背景毎のコモンイベントより先に実行されます。",
      "sourceHash": "60f09fc749887e9a6d343e260c572e1b04faef89643ca902fc7199eb9a5b3870",
      "translation": "It is executed before the common event for each background.",
      "contextHash": "60f09fc749887e9a6d343e260c572e1b04faef89643ca902fc7199eb9a5b3870"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-017",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "画像のロードを待つ（WaitLoadImage）",
      "sourceHash": "3f242a608f6fb82f2f17240d2d53b673420577cee6cd9a352c841e8478d2f8a1",
      "translation": "Wait for Images to Load (WaitLoadImage)",
      "contextHash": "3f242a608f6fb82f2f17240d2d53b673420577cee6cd9a352c841e8478d2f8a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-023",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "コモンイベント内で画像の表示を指定した場合、画像の読込完了までフェードインを待ちます。",
      "sourceHash": "9045c4ad666f9f5ead35934d53bc02cd0ce39d13dcef675164f6d265f82cf123",
      "translation": "If displaying an image is specified in a common event, the fade-in waits until the image has finished loading.",
      "contextHash": "9045c4ad666f9f5ead35934d53bc02cd0ce39d13dcef675164f6d265f82cf123"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-024",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "これにより、戦闘画面表示後に画像が遅れて表示される問題に対処できます。",
      "sourceHash": "b719b4dbe07d3d074a80915f7ee5350b900b13fc2b3633b5e38845ca697de3b3",
      "translation": "This addresses the issue of images appearing late after the battle screen is displayed.",
      "contextHash": "b719b4dbe07d3d074a80915f7ee5350b900b13fc2b3633b5e38845ca697de3b3"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-018",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "戦闘背景のプラグインパラメータ（Parameters Battleback）",
      "sourceHash": "665f5423c3810788cdba8b6daf0bc51be4006e4e715f8a63630f469929bd7bbf",
      "translation": "Battle Background Plugin Parameters (Parameters Battleback)",
      "contextHash": "665f5423c3810788cdba8b6daf0bc51be4006e4e715f8a63630f469929bd7bbf"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-025",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "戦闘背景用のプラグインパラメータです。",
      "sourceHash": "bca0f03ce0dd4155b6d59fc04b3ccaddc48fee56b4ccf3f575185e5770bb9794",
      "translation": "Plugin parameters for battle backgrounds.",
      "contextHash": "bca0f03ce0dd4155b6d59fc04b3ccaddc48fee56b4ccf3f575185e5770bb9794"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-026",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "戦闘背景１（Battleback1）と戦闘背景２（Battleback2）の二種類があります。",
      "sourceHash": "b299cabe0fe117f51e573de166a0e313226b52eb8f5b96552f56e58fee1f7555",
      "translation": "There are two types: Battleback 1 (Battleback1) and Battleback 2 (Battleback2).",
      "contextHash": "b299cabe0fe117f51e573de166a0e313226b52eb8f5b96552f56e58fee1f7555"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-019",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "メモ（Memo）",
      "sourceHash": "ecf79de284259bef8059ddc96657d8c07c1147c1d8f17aac032912211a157fc8",
      "translation": "Memo (Memo)",
      "contextHash": "ecf79de284259bef8059ddc96657d8c07c1147c1d8f17aac032912211a157fc8"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-027",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "判別用のメモです。",
      "sourceHash": "ac9951beae559fbdd4f2d7110807b72fd5bf1830ed139e028a1e0bb31f4631f6",
      "translation": "A memo used for identification.",
      "contextHash": "ac9951beae559fbdd4f2d7110807b72fd5bf1830ed139e028a1e0bb31f4631f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-028",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "分かりやすい名前を付けてください。",
      "sourceHash": "ecf58753baa9e3150ec2a5d25cc5c895477ac054197eff47daa4527ac456598a",
      "translation": "Give it an easy-to-understand name.",
      "contextHash": "ecf58753baa9e3150ec2a5d25cc5c895477ac054197eff47daa4527ac456598a"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-020",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "戦闘背景１（Battleback1）",
      "sourceHash": "f71fe6e9836e65751581ff0f96da56f0685f4e3320d40a1cb3c826fddf13cbf9",
      "translation": "Battleback 1 (Battleback1)",
      "contextHash": "f71fe6e9836e65751581ff0f96da56f0685f4e3320d40a1cb3c826fddf13cbf9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-029",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "実行条件となる戦闘背景（下）です。",
      "sourceHash": "65284be1c8f1aa88372052c35d5747be067489bcda0f8fbfdb2c2a1623b3e5da",
      "translation": "The battle background (lower) used as an execution condition.",
      "contextHash": "65284be1c8f1aa88372052c35d5747be067489bcda0f8fbfdb2c2a1623b3e5da"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-021",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "戦闘背景２（Battleback2）",
      "sourceHash": "6a59248fb2ce18203914fa5c7db368795943735078c1c40a0935c9dd31f859ec",
      "translation": "Battleback 2 (Battleback2)",
      "contextHash": "6a59248fb2ce18203914fa5c7db368795943735078c1c40a0935c9dd31f859ec"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-030",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "実行条件となる戦闘背景（上）です。",
      "sourceHash": "106556b3fa326479fe1f3d0a744808049e9cd657a577d716060562aa23ae01d9",
      "translation": "This is the battle background (upper) that serves as the execution condition.",
      "contextHash": "106556b3fa326479fe1f3d0a744808049e9cd657a577d716060562aa23ae01d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-022",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "スイッチ（Switch）",
      "sourceHash": "47d3a1306fa93ec24f65abc28fc9e4790ce4e05a03f888af5f4024e2d2e5ea78",
      "translation": "Switch (Switch)",
      "contextHash": "47d3a1306fa93ec24f65abc28fc9e4790ce4e05a03f888af5f4024e2d2e5ea78"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-031",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "実行条件となるスイッチです。",
      "sourceHash": "bdc42601ae828d94e1798736e2572560bb7af04d906e1d849cfe81579c1fb9fe",
      "translation": "This is the switch that serves as the execution condition.",
      "contextHash": "bdc42601ae828d94e1798736e2572560bb7af04d906e1d849cfe81579c1fb9fe"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-023",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "Dynamic用スキル（DynamicSkill）",
      "sourceHash": "6dcb1c3b16fa697a94578fd94888a39f15d26683ca6aac595362f60e020f4460",
      "translation": "Skill for Dynamic (DynamicSkill)",
      "contextHash": "6dcb1c3b16fa697a94578fd94888a39f15d26683ca6aac595362f60e020f4460"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-032",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "実行するDynamicAnimationのスキルです。",
      "sourceHash": "13635047db376f2b744f7b8c735ed9b6fcf1f0318aeb4d688352315bab8c1ce7",
      "translation": "This is the skill for the DynamicAnimation to execute.",
      "contextHash": "13635047db376f2b744f7b8c735ed9b6fcf1f0318aeb4d688352315bab8c1ce7"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-024",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "コモンイベント（CommonEvent）ver1.01",
      "sourceHash": "be0ae8f4444d4206879c7360be91c2924a5b6e4732e4bb97b9131b49afa898b8",
      "translation": "Common Event (CommonEvent) ver1.01",
      "contextHash": "be0ae8f4444d4206879c7360be91c2924a5b6e4732e4bb97b9131b49afa898b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-033",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "戦闘開始直後に実行するコモンイベントです。",
      "sourceHash": "70562a89d198df969f456a7d131d0c82d53aeab6cb86960078be255c5b956578",
      "translation": "This is the common event to execute immediately after the battle starts.",
      "contextHash": "70562a89d198df969f456a7d131d0c82d53aeab6cb86960078be255c5b956578"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-034",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "画面のフェードインより先に実行されます。",
      "sourceHash": "cc256430bbe09e6980ad295958b50b4ba4679c8a2931e65eeba628709bd5c52c",
      "translation": "It is executed before the screen fades in.",
      "contextHash": "cc256430bbe09e6980ad295958b50b4ba4679c8a2931e65eeba628709bd5c52c"
    }
  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "line-001",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "『[[LINK_1]]コモンイベントの並列処理を戦闘中も有効に[[/LINK_1]]』でも同じようなことができるので、状況に応じて使いやすい方法を選んでください。フィールドなど地形に応じて戦闘背景が変わる場面では、当プラグインのほうが使いやすいと思います。",
      "sourceHash": "f6d73773e00474e3f6652617d1856f1519958276c30f8c4ac348ac56b643b446",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "『",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "コモンイベントの並列処理を戦闘中も有効に",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "』でも同じようなことができるので、状況に応じて使いやすい方法を選んでください。フィールドなど地形に応じて戦闘背景が変わる場面では、当プラグインのほうが使いやすいと思います。",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "You can do something similar with 『[[LINK_1]]Enable Parallel Processing of Common Events During Battles[[/LINK_1]]』, so please choose the method that is easiest to use for your situation. This plugin should be easier to use in situations where the battle background changes according to the terrain, such as on the field.",
      "contextHash": "f6d73773e00474e3f6652617d1856f1519958276c30f8c4ac348ac56b643b446"
    },
