      ],
      "translation": "Added [[LINK_1]]a common common event at the start of battle[[/LINK_1]].",
      "contextHash": "f20c4be847df025d89ad57a802c9f2bbf84737c004bb5525bb4bc91d6520a9fc"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-018",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "コモンイベント内で画像の表示を指定した場合、[[LINK_1]]画像の読込完了までフェードインを待つ[[/LINK_1]]ように対応。",
      "sourceHash": "05cb85e79b788e92eea0b97ad833468005fded7ee2a666402e598202c8aeb311",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "コモンイベント内で画像の表示を指定した場合、",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "画像の読込完了までフェードインを待つ",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "ように対応。",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "When displaying an image is specified within a common event, it now [[LINK_1]]waits for the image to finish loading before fading in[[/LINK_1]].",
      "contextHash": "05cb85e79b788e92eea0b97ad833468005fded7ee2a666402e598202c8aeb311"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-019",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "[[LINK_1]]コモンイベントの実行機能[[/LINK_1]]を追加。",
      "sourceHash": "6804fea60acd3e68300da9596e131fd8c8153fbe3dd4b517ac5f40b5a09c1f6d",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "コモンイベントの実行機能",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
