          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Added [[LINK_1]]the function to execute common events[[/LINK_1]].",
      "contextHash": "6804fea60acd3e68300da9596e131fd8c8153fbe3dd4b517ac5f40b5a09c1f6d"
    },
    {
      "id": "line-020",
      "type": "line",
      "source": "スイッチをオンにして『[[LINK_1]]コモンイベントの並列処理を戦闘中も有効に[[/LINK_1]]』と連携したり、『[[LINK_2]]自在に遠景を表示[[/LINK_2]]』と組み合わせるといった用途を想定しています。",
      "sourceHash": "63d426a204ea3f53067b1382a835c3715a7c0a30c7476a19dfc4e937743bc5fd",
      "parts": [
        {
          "source": "スイッチをオンにして『",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "コモンイベントの並列処理を戦闘中も有効に",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 1
        },
        {
          "source": "』と連携したり、『",
          "link": false
        },
        {
          "source": "自在に遠景を表示",
          "link": true,
          "linkIndex": 2
        },
        {
          "source": "』と組み合わせるといった用途を想定しています。",
          "link": false
        }
      ],
      "translation": "It is intended for uses such as turning on a switch and integrating with 『[[LINK_1]]Enable Parallel Processing of Common Events During Battles[[/LINK_1]]』, or combining it with 『[[LINK_2]]Display distant backgrounds freely[[/LINK_2]]』.",
      "contextHash": "63d426a204ea3f53067b1382a835c3715a7c0a30c7476a19dfc4e937743bc5fd"
    },
